# Core

- Orient: `docs/README.md` → `docs/ai/context-map.md`. Setup: `docs/setup/install-and-deploy.md`.
- One `RoomModel`; scan adapters only. No mode branching in routing/estimate.
- Phase 1: planes + place + JSON. No RoomPlan/PDF/cloud unless asked. `docs/product/roadmap.md`.
- Agent EN; product/UX RU OK; code EN. Conventions: `docs/ai/conventions.md`.
- Change behavior/schema/stack/phase → update `docs/` + rules/`AGENTS.md` same change.
- Auto-extend `.gitignore` / `.cursorignore` when adding caches, builds, secrets, generated Unity junk, or large binaries. Never commit secrets/`Library`/`Builds`.
- Small diffs. Ask before packages/top-level folders.
